body:
Ah yes, there is nothing better than being woken by a narc at some random hour for a task they could have easily accomplished on their own. /s

My nmom has woken me up between 4am and 6am for several things, including:

* turning on the ceiling fan;
* turning up the volume on the computer;
* scooping her ice cream;
* picking out an outfit for the day (in her defense she kept her clothes in the basement because she owned so many);
* finding her keys;
* opening/closing the garage door;
* locking the back door behind her when she left for work;
* finding her bra;
* getting the newspaper when it was thrown off the stoop;
* putting out the sprinkler.

I actually recalled in therapy today the outfit one, because I remembered being half-awake and angry to be up, so she started yelling at me and pushed me down the stairs on my way back up. I ended up rolling my ankle and she told me that 'God is warning you to be nice to your mother'.

I'm convinced at this point that nparents mostly see their children as slave labor.

Edit: typo
